        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8b7a0e13-0311-5078-b72a-b824fdec3a1e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miles Doleac, Christopher Walken, Johnny Depp, Christina Ricci, Washington Irving\n- Films: Sleepy Hollow, The Hollow\n- Television Shows: Treme, Sleepy Hollow, American Horror Story, Salem, Complications, Roots, Containment\n- Topics: Acting roles, film adaptation, crime film\n\nFacts:\n- Since 2011, Miles Doleac has had acting roles in the television shows and productions Treme, Sleepy Hollow, American Horror Story, Salem, Complications, Roots, and several episodes of the CW series Containment.\n- Sleepy Hollow is a film adaptation loosely inspired by Washington Irving’s 1820 short story The Legend of Sleepy Hollow.\n- Sleepy Hollow stars Johnny Depp and Christina Ricci, with Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, and Jeffrey Jones in supporting roles.\n- Christopher Walken, born Ronald Walken on March 31, 1943, is an American stage and film actor.\n- Christopher Walken has appeared in more than 100 films and television shows, including Sleepy Hollow (1999) and many other films from 1977 through 2016.\n- The Hollow is a 2016 American crime film that was written and directed by Miles Doleac.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
